      "html": "<style>\n.enc-perche{background:#151412;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:96px}\n.enc-perche .enc-big{color:#F4F0E8;max-width:22em}\n.enc-punti{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:32px}\n.enc-punti li{color:#F4F0E8;font-size:16px;padding-top:24px;border-top:1px solid #8C857B;max-width:16em}\n@media (max-width:1024px){.enc-punti{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:40px 32px}}\n@media (max-width:767px){.enc-perche{gap:64px}.enc-punti{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px}}</style><div class=\"enc-perche enc-in enc-sez\">\n<p class=\"enc-serif enc-big\">Your unsold stock is frozen capital. Encore turns it into fibre you buy back below market price, protecting your brand and your margin.</p>\n<ul class=\"enc-punti\"><li class=\"enc-small\">One partner instead of dozens of recyclers to vet</li><li class=\"enc-small\">A certificate no one can falsify</li><li class=\"enc-small\">Answers in plain language, not spreadsheets</li><li class=\"enc-small\">Your products never reach the grey market</li></ul>\n</div>"
